{"title":"Proper fraction","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>proper fraction</b> is a fraction such that the absolute value is less than 1.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Examples\">Examples</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Proper_fraction&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Examples\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba79a3b420c2b046c10ce91023556e45ef438e18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\neq4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/ecaf7ffef857dcfaea32fcd5f1e250bd29f40934.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3&lt;4.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Proper_fraction&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Improper_fraction\" title=\"Improper fraction\">Improper fraction</a>\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Proper_fraction&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017181103\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor vi